  "goodToKnow": "Die Bohrung is drilling or a borehole: eine Bohrung nach Öl, eine Probebohrung (test drilling), Geothermiebohrungen for heat pumps. The Kontinentale Tiefbohrung in Bavaria (KTB, 1987–1994) reached over 9,100 metres, one of the deepest boreholes in the world. Bohren means to drill, and figuratively bohrende Fragen are probing questions. Plural: die Bohrungen."
